{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#card-zh","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode session header 是供 DSH 使用的 Host bundle：它包装 host 进程的 globalThis.fetch，为发往 opencode.ai 及其子域名且缺少 x-opencode-session 的请求补上进程内稳定的合法标头；已有标头时保持原值，其他域名不处理。插件通过 bundle 注册并在卸载时恢复 fetch，适合使用 OpenCode Go 且存在未携带会话 ID 的手工模型请求的场景。它不要求额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-36","index.js:84-120","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#card-en","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"OpenCode session header is a DSH host bundle that wraps globalThis.fetch and adds a stable x-opencode-session header to opencode.ai requests only when missing. It preserves existing values, ignores other hosts, and restores fetch on unload. No extra configuration is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-36","index.js:84-120","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#intent-1","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"让 DSH 发往 OpenCode Go 的请求自动带上缺失的会话标头。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:84-103"]}
{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#intent-2","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode Go 返回 MissingSessionID 时，怎么补齐请求头？","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:84-103"]}
