{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#intent-4","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"已有会话标头时保持原值，同时只修补缺失的请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:84-103"]}
