{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#intent-6","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"How can I fix MissingSessionID errors from manually assembled requests?","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:84-103"]}
{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#feature-1","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode session header 的功能「只为目标主机补标头」：包装 fetch 并匹配 opencode.ai 及其子域名；目标请求缺少 x-opencode-session 时添加进程内稳定的 token。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:67-75"]}
{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#feature-2","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode session header 的功能「保留调用方已有标头」：检查请求头是否已有 x-opencode-session；若存在则原样转发，不覆盖调用方提供的值。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:90-93"]}
{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#feature-3","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode session header 的功能「卸载时恢复 fetch」：插件激活时保存并替换全局 fetch，注册清理回调，在卸载时恢复原函数并清除重复激活标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:111-120"]}
{"unit_id":"NotKeKe__dsh-opencode-session-header#caveat-1","repo":"NotKeKe/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"dc8ff6113e3d50738b09492159c2e48239e53d78","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode Go 请求会被发送到 opencode.ai；插件为缺少标头的请求补上进程级稳定 token，同一进程的注入请求共享该路由键。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:16-25","index.js:35-48","index.js:84-98"]}
